# Redux saga

Components dispatch actions. Sagas call the API. Keep loading and error on the slice.

Do not `fetch` inside a component. Upload and college import run in sagas.

```ts
// BAD
const jobs = await fetch("/api/v1/jobs");
// GOOD
dispatch(jobsRequested({ status: "approved" }));
```
